msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, project bin, working, using, documentation, user manual, "
"video editor, open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, projektový zásobník, práca, používanie, documentation,user "
"manual,  video editor, open source, zadarmo, učiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:25
msgid "Using the Project Bin"
msgstr "Používanie projektového zásobníka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:27
msgid ""
"The Project Bin\\ [1]_ is where all your :term:`assets <Asset>` are. "
"Depending on the size of your project, that list can quickly become "
"confusing and difficult to work with. Kdenlive has several features to "
"manage the bin's content."
msgstr ""
"Projektový zásobník\\ [1]_ je miesto, kde sa nachádzajú všetky vaše :term:"
"`prostriedky<Asset>`. V závislosti od veľkosti projektu môže tento zoznam "
"rýchlo zneprerehľadniť a stať sa ťažko použiteľným. Kdenlive disponuje "
"niekoľkými funkciami na správu obsahu zásobníka."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:31
msgid "User Interface"
msgstr "Užívateľské rozhranie"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:38
msgid "The Project Bin in Kdenlive"
msgstr "Projektový zásobník v Kdenlive"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:45
msgid "**1**"
msgstr "**1**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:46
msgid ""
"|kdenlive-add-clip|\\ :guilabel:`Add clip or folder` opens a window similar "
"to the file manager of your OS allowing you to navigate around your file "
"system and select :doc:`files to be added </project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin/clips>` to the project bin."
msgstr ""
"|kdenlive-add-clip|\\ :guilabel:`Add clip or folder` otvorí okno podobné "
"správcovi súborov vášho OS, čo vám umožní navigovať v súborovom systéme a "
"vybrať :doc:`súbory na pridanie</project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"clips>` do projektového zásobníka."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:48
msgid ""
"|go-down| opens a pop-up window from where you can select what kind of clip "
"you want to add"
msgstr ""
"|go-down| otvorí vyskakovacie okno, v ktorom môžete vybrať, aký typ klipu "
"chcete pridať"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:50
msgid ""
"|folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Add folder` creates a :doc:`new folder </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders>` in the "
"current project bin. These are virtual folders that help you organize large "
"bins. Folders can be turned into their own bins."
msgstr ""
"|folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Add folder` vytvorí :doc:`nový priečinok </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders>` v "
"aktuálnom projektovom zásobníku. Sú to virtuálne priečinky, ktoré pomáhajú "
"organizovať rozsiahle zásobníky. Priečinky môžu byť prevedené na vlastné "
"zásobníky."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:51
msgid "**2**"
msgstr "**2**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:52
msgid ""
"|edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete clip or folder` deletes the currently "
"selected clip or folder from the bin"
msgstr ""
"|edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete clip or folder` odstráni aktuálne vybraný "
"klip alebo priečinok zo zásobníka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:53
msgid "**3**"
msgstr "**3**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:54
msgid ""
"|tag|\\ :guilabel:`Tags Panel` toggles the :doc:`tags "
"<project_bin_use_tags>` panel"
msgstr ""
"|tag|\\ :guilabel:`Tags Panel` prepína panel :doc:`značiek "
"<project_bin_use_tags>`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:55
msgid "**4**"
msgstr "**4**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:56
msgid ""
"|application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` opens a pop-window with more "
"`options` including the option to :ref:`scale <scaling_the_view>` the view"
msgstr ""
"|application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` otvorí vyskakovacie okno s ďalšími "
"`možnosťami` vrátane možnosti :ref:`meniť mierku <scaling_the_view>` "
"zobrazenia"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:57
msgid "**5**"
msgstr "**5**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:58
msgid ""
"|view-filter|\\ :guilabel:`Filter` switches a :doc:`filter "
"<project_bin_use_filters>` on or off"
msgstr ""
"|view-filter|\\ :guilabel:`Filter` zapne alebo vypne :doc:`filter "
"<project_bin_use_filters>`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:60
msgid ""
"|go-down|\\ :guilabel:`Filter` opens a pop-up window to :doc:`set filter "
"<project_bin_use_filters>` parameters"
msgstr ""
"|go-down|\\ :guilabel:`Filter` otvorí vyskakovacie okno na :doc:`nastavenie "
"parametrov filtra <project_bin_use_filters>`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:61
msgid "**6**"
msgstr "**6**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:62
msgid ""
"Search field to :doc:`search for assets <project_bin_use_searching>` in the "
"bin"
msgstr ""
"Vyhľadávacie pole na :doc:`vyhľadávanie prostriedkov "
"<project_bin_use_searching>` v zásobníku"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:63
msgid "**7**"
msgstr "**7**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:64
msgid ""
"|go-up|\\ :guilabel:`Sort` Toggles between sorting ascending and descending"
msgstr ""
"|go-up|\\ :guilabel:`Sort` prepína medzi zoradením vzostupne a zostupne"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:65
msgid "**8**"
msgstr "**8**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:66
msgid ""
"The folder with all the sequences. It is there even if you did not :doc:"
"`create a sequence </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/sequence>`."
msgstr ""
"Priečinok so všetkými sekvenciami. Existuje aj vtedy, ak ste :doc:`sekvenciu "
"nevytvorili </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/sequence>`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:67
msgid "**9**"
msgstr "**9**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:68
msgid ""
"Folders created by the user (for illustration purposes only). You can turn "
"folders into :doc:`individual bins <project_bin_use_multiple_bins>` that can "
"be added to your workspace and docked."
msgstr ""
"Priečinky vytvorené používateľom (len na ilustráciu). Priečinky môžete "
"premeniť na :doc:`samostatné zásobníky <project_bin_use_multiple_bins>`, "
"ktoré môžete pridať do pracovného priestoru a umiestniť do panela."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:69
msgid "**10**"
msgstr "**10**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:70
msgid "|kdenlive-audio| indicates a file with an audio stream"
msgstr "|kdenlive-audio| označuje súbor so zvukovým tokom"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:72
msgid "|kdenlive-show-video| indicates a file with a video stream"
msgstr "|kdenlive-show-video| označuje súbor s obrazovým tokom"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:73
msgid "**11**"
msgstr "**11**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:74
msgid ""
"Indicators for duration of the clip in the format :abbr:`hh:mm:ss:ff(hours:"
"minutes:seconds:frames)`, and the number of instances in sequences (first "
"number) and the timeline (second number)."
msgstr ""
"Indikátory trvania klipu vo formáte :abbr:`hh:mm:ss:ff(hours:minutes:seconds:"
"frames)` a počtu výskytov v sekvenciách (prvé číslo) a na časovej osi (druhé "
"číslo)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:80
msgid "Scaling the View"
msgstr "Zmena mierky zobrazenia"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:82
msgid "You can zoom the project bin view in and out."
msgstr "Zobrazenie projektového zásobníka môžete priblížiť alebo oddialiť."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:91
#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:110
#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:131
msgid "Scaling the project bin view"
msgstr "Zmena mierky zobrazenia projektového zásobníka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click on the |application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` icon and use the "
"slider or the buttons to the left or right of it to increase or decrease the "
"zoom level."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ikonu |application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` a pomocou "
"posuvníka alebo tlačidiel naľavo či napravo od neho zvýšte alebo znížte "
"úroveň priblíženia."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:99
msgid "Changing the View"
msgstr "Zmena zobrazenia"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:101
msgid ""
"You can switch the project bin view from Tree View to Icon View, change the "
"sort criterion, show additional columns for Date, Description, Rating, and "
"have a preview in the thumbnails for video files."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazenie projektového zásobníka môžete prepnúť zo stromového zobrazenia na "
"zobrazenie ikon, zmeniť kritérium zoradenia, zobraziť ďalšie stĺpce pre "
"dátum, popis, hodnotenie a mať náhľad v miniatúrach pre videosúbory."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:112
msgid ""
"Click on the |application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` icon and select the :"
"guilabel:`View Mode`, :guilabel:`Sort By` criteria, and tick the boxes for "
"additional columns."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ikonu |application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` a vyberte :"
"guilabel:`View Mode`, kritériá :guilabel:`Sort By` a začiarknite políčka pre "
"ďalšie stĺpce."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:114
msgid ""
"Select |favorite|\\ :guilabel:`Disable Bin Effects` to (temporarily) disable "
"any effect applied to a clip in the Project Bin. See also the chapter about :"
"doc:`/effects_and_filters` and  :ref:`effects_everywhere-bin_clips`."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte |favorite|\\ :guilabel:`Disable Bin Effects` na (dočasné) vypnutie "
"všetkých efektov aplikovaných na klip v projektovom zásobníku. Pozrite si aj "
"kapitolu o :doc:`/effects_and_filters` a :ref:`effects_everywhere-bin_clips`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:120
msgid "Thumbnail Video Preview"
msgstr "Náhľad videa v miniatúrach"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:122
msgid ""
"A neat feature is to have a preview in the thumbnails for video files. This "
"allows scrubbing in the thumbnail to quickly check whether that particular "
"clip has the scene or footage you are looking for."
msgstr ""
"Užitočnou funkciou je náhľad v miniatúrach pre videosúbory. Umožňuje to "
"prehrabávanie v miniatúre na rýchle overenie, či daný klip obsahuje scénu "
"alebo záber, ktorý hľadáte."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:133
msgid ""
"Check the :guilabel:`Show Video Preview in Thumbnails` to enable the feature."
msgstr ""
"Zaškrtnite :guilabel:`Show Video Preview in Thumbnails` na aktiváciu tejto "
"funkcie."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:139
msgid ""
"This will trigger several clip jobs to generate the video previews. "
"Depending on the size of your project bin and video assets this may take a "
"while. You can continue working with Kdenlive but expect some performance "
"degradation."
msgstr ""
"Tým sa spustí niekoľko úloh klipov na generovanie náhľadov videa. V "
"závislosti od veľkosti projektového zásobníka a videoprostriedkov to môže "
"chvíľu trvať. Môžete pokračovať v práci s Kdenlive, ale počítajte s určitým "
"znížením výkonu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use.rst:160
msgid ""
"In earlier versions of Kdenlive this view was known as the Project Tree."
msgstr ""
"V starších verziách Kdenlive bolo toto zobrazenie známe ako Strom projektu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Using the Project Bin - Clip Context Menu"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Using the Project Bin - Clip Context Menu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:72
msgid "Context Menu"
msgstr "Kontextová ponuka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:74
msgid ""
"Right-click on any asset or item in the Project Bin to get a context menu "
"with several and different options depending on the asset or item you used "
"it on. The menu is also available via :menuselection:`Menu --> Clip`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite pravým tlačidlom myši na ľubovoľný prostriedok alebo položku v "
"projektovom zásobníku a zobrazí sa kontextové menu s rôznymi možnosťami v "
"závislosti od prostriedku alebo položky. Menu je dostupné aj cez :"
"menuselection:`Menu --> Clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:80
msgid "The context menu for bin items"
msgstr "Kontextové menu pre položky zásobníka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:85
msgid "|extract_audio|:"
msgstr "|extract_audio|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:85
msgid ""
"Extracts the audio stream of the clip and adds a :file:`.wav` file with a "
"sample rate of 48kHz to the project bin. Is only available if the clip is of "
"type :file:`audio` or a video file with an audio stream. For further details "
"see the chapter :ref:`extract_audio`."
msgstr ""
"Extrahuje zvukový tok klipu a pridá súbor :file:`.wav` so vzorkovacou "
"frekvenciou 48 kHz do projektového zásobníka. Je dostupné iba ak je klip "
"typu :file:`audio` alebo videosúbor so zvukovým tokom. Ďalšie podrobnosti "
"nájdete v kapitole :ref:`extract_audio`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:88
msgid "Opens a flyout with additional options"
msgstr "Otvorí rozbaľovaciu ponuku s ďalšími možnosťami"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:90
msgid "|my_custom_job| runs the clip job *My Custom Job*"
msgstr "|my_custom_job| spustí úlohu klipu *My Custom Job*"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:92
msgid ""
"|scene_split| runs a clip job that detects scene changes and creates "
"individual clips for each detected scene. For further details see the "
"chapter :ref:`automatic_scene_split`."
msgstr ""
"|scene_split| spustí úlohu klipu, ktorá detekuje zmeny scén a vytvorí "
"samostatné klipy pre každú detekovanú scénu. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v "
"kapitole :ref:`automatic_scene_split`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:94
msgid "|stabilize| runs a stabilizer. See also the chapter :ref:`stabilize`."
msgstr ""
"|stabilize| spustí stabilizátor. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:`stabilize`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:96
msgid ""
"|duplicate_clip_speed| creates a copy of the selected clip and applies a "
"speed change you can specify in a dialog window. For further details see the "
"chapter  :ref:`duplicate_clip_with_speed_change`."
msgstr ""
"|duplicate_clip_speed| vytvorí kópiu vybraného klipu a aplikuje zmenu "
"rýchlosti, ktorú môžete určiť v dialógovom okne. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete "
"v kapitole :ref:`duplicate_clip_with_speed_change`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:98
msgid "|media_jobs|:"
msgstr "|media_jobs|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:98
msgid ""
"|configure_clip_jobs| opens a window to manage clip jobs. See also the "
"chapter :ref:`configure_clip_jobs`"
msgstr ""
"|configure_clip_jobs| otvorí okno na správu úloh klipov. Pozrite si aj "
"kapitolu :ref:`configure_clip_jobs`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:101
msgid "|clip_in_timeline|:"
msgstr "|clip_in_timeline|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:101
msgid ""
"Opens a flyout with a list of all the instances of the selected clip in the "
"timeline. For example |track_timecode| indicates that this clip is in video "
"track `V2` at position (timecode) `00:00:22:15` (format is :abbr:`hh:mm:ss:"
"ff(hours:minutes:seconds:frames)`)"
msgstr ""
"Otvorí rozbaľovací zoznam všetkých výskytov vybraného klipu na časovej osi. "
"Napríklad |track_timecode| označuje, že tento klip je vo videostope `V2` na "
"pozícii (časový kód) `00:00:22:15` (formát je :abbr:`hh:mm:ss:ff(hours:"
"minutes:seconds:frames)`)"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:104
msgid "|locate_clip|:"
msgstr "|locate_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:104
msgid ""
"Opens the folder in your file system where the selected clip is located in "
"your OS default file manager. See also the chapter :ref:`locate_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí priečinok v súborovom systéme, kde sa nachádza vybraný klip, vo "
"výchozom správcovi súborov vášho OS. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:"
"`locate_clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:107
msgid "|reload_clip|:"
msgstr "|reload_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:107
msgid ""
"Reloads the selected clip from the file system. See also the chapter :ref:"
"`reload_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Znovu načíta vybraný klip zo súborového systému. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:"
"`reload_clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:110
msgid "|replace_clip|:"
msgstr "|replace_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:110
msgid ""
"Opens your OS file manager. Select the file you want to replace the selected "
"clip with. See also the chapter :ref:`replace_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí správcu súborov vášho OS. Vyberte súbor, ktorým chcete nahradiť "
"vybraný klip. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:`replace_clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:113
msgid "|replace_clip_in_timeline|:"
msgstr "|replace_clip_in_timeline|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:113
msgid ""
"You need to select two clips in the bin for this action. The clip you right-"
"clicked on will be replace by the other. See also the chapter :ref:"
"`replace_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Pre túto akciu musíte v zásobníku vybrať dva klipy. Klip, na ktorý ste "
"klikli pravým tlačidlom, bude nahradený tým druhým. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :"
"ref:`replace_clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:116
msgid "|duplicate_clip|:"
msgstr "|duplicate_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:116
msgid ""
"Creates a copy of the selected clip. See also the chapter :ref:"
"`duplicate_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Vytvorí kópiu vybraného klipu. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:`duplicate_clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:119
msgid "|transcode|:"
msgstr "|transcode|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:119
msgid ""
"Opens a window with the selected clips where you can select the format to "
"transcode the clips to. See also the chapter :ref:"
"`transcode_to_edit_friendly_format`."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí okno s vybranými klipmi, kde môžete zvoliť formát, do ktorého sa "
"klipy prekonvertujú. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:"
"`transcode_to_edit_friendly_format`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:122
msgid "|proxy_clip|:"
msgstr "|proxy_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:122
msgid ""
"If checked indicates that the selected clip is a proxy clip* :ref:"
"`make_proxy_clip`. If the option is greyed out, proxy clips are not enabled "
"for the project. Go to the :doc:`/project_and_asset_management/"
"project_settings/proxy_settings` tab in the Project Settings (:menuselection:"
"`Menu --> File --> Project Settings`) and enable proxy clips."
msgstr ""
"Ak je zaškrtnuté, označuje, že vybraný klip je proxy klip* :ref:"
"`make_proxy_clip`. Ak je možnosť sivá, proxy klipy nie sú pre projekt "
"povolené. Prejdite na kartu :doc:`/project_and_asset_management/"
"project_settings/proxy_settings` v nastaveniach projektu (:menuselection:"
"`Menu --> File --> Project Settings`) a povoľte proxy klipy."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:125
msgid "|clip_properties|:"
msgstr "|clip_properties|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:125
msgid ""
"Opens the widget for the Clip Properties. For more details refer to the "
"chapter :ref:`media_menu-clip_properties`."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí widget Vlastnosti klipu. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v kapitole :ref:"
"`media_menu-clip_properties`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:128
msgid "|edit_clip|:"
msgstr "|edit_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:128
msgid ""
"Opens the application associated with the type of the selected clip. See "
"also the chapter :ref:`edit_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí aplikáciu priradenú k typu vybraného klipu. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :"
"ref:`edit_clip`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:131
msgid "|rename_clip| (default keyboard shortcut :kbd:`F2`):"
msgstr "|rename_clip| (predvolená klávesová skratka :kbd:`F2`):"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:131
msgid ""
"Opens the clip name field in the bin for editing. This does not change the "
"filename in the file system."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí pole názvu klipu v zásobníku na úpravu. Tým sa nemení názov súboru v "
"súborovom systéme."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:134
msgid "|delete_clip|:"
msgstr "|delete_clip|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_context_menu.rst:134
msgid ""
"Deletes the selected clips. If the clips are being used in the timeline or "
"in sequences, a warning windows is opened where you need to confirm that the "
"clips' instances in the timeline will also be deleted. See also the chapter :"
"ref:`delete_clip`."
msgstr ""
"Odstráni vybrané klipy. Ak sa klipy používajú na časovej osi alebo v "
"sekvenciách, otvorí sa varovné okno, kde musíte potvrdiť, že výskyty klipov "
"na časovej osi budú tiež odstránené. Pozrite si aj kapitolu :ref:"
"`delete_clip`."

