#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:34
msgid "Using Filters"
msgstr "Používanie filtrov"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:36
msgid ""
"Filters are an easy way to quickly narrow down assets by tag, rating, type, "
"or whether or not they are being used in the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Filtre sú jednoduchý spôsob, ako rýchlo zúžiť zoznam prostriedkov podľa "
"značky, hodnotenia, typu alebo toho, či sa používajú na časovej osi."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:47
#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:71
msgid "Filtering options"
msgstr "Možnosti filtrovania"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:49
msgid "Category *Tags*"
msgstr "Kategória *Značky*"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:51
msgid "Category *Rating*"
msgstr "Kategória *Hodnotenie*"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:53
msgid "Category *Usage*"
msgstr "Kategória *Použitie*"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:55
msgid "Category *Type*"
msgstr "Kategória *Typ*"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:60
msgid ""
"Filters are applied in an OR way between objects of the same category, and "
"in an AND way between different categories."
msgstr ""
"Filtre sa aplikujú spôsobom OR medzi objektmi rovnakej kategórie a spôsobom "
"AND medzi rôznymi kategóriami."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:63
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Príklad"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:73
msgid ""
"This filter setting shows all assets that have a *red* OR *blue* tag, AND "
"have a rating of *4 stars*, AND are *unused*, AND are an *AV Clip* (file "
"with video and audio streams) OR a *Mute Video* (file with only a video "
"stream)."
msgstr ""
"Toto nastavenie filtra zobrazuje všetky prostriedky, ktoré majú *červenú* "
"ALEBO *modrú* značku, A majú hodnotenie *4 hviezdičky*, A sú *nepoužité*, A "
"sú *AV Klip* (súbor s obrazovým a zvukovým tokom) ALEBO *Stíhané video* "
"(súbor iba s obrazovým tokom)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_filters.rst:77
msgid ""
"If filter criteria have been set, the filter icon in the project bin toolbar "
"changes background color. Filter **on**: |filter-on| - filter **off**: |"
"filter-off|"
msgstr ""
"Ak boli nastavené kritériá filtra, ikona filtra na paneli nástrojov "
"projektového zásobníka zmení farbu pozadia. Filter **zapnutý**: |filter-on| "
"– filter **vypnutý**: |filter-off|"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Using the Project Bin - Folders"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Using the Project Bin - Folders"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, project bin, folder, using, documentation, user manual, video "
"editor, open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, project bin, folder, using, documentation, user manual,video  "
"editor, open source, zadarmo, učiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:42
msgid "Folders"
msgstr "Priečinky"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:44
msgid ""
"Folders help keeping the Project Bin organized, structured, and easy to "
"navigate. Folders can be nested and turned into :doc:`individual bins "
"<project_bin_use_multiple_bins>`."
msgstr ""
"Priečinky pomáhajú udržiavať projektový zásobník usporiadaný, štruktúrovaný "
"a ľahko navigovateľný. Priečinky môžu byť vnorené a prevedené na :doc:"
"`samostatné zásobníky <project_bin_use_multiple_bins>`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:53
msgid "Creating folders in the project bin"
msgstr "Vytváranie priečinkov v projektovom zásobníku"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:55
msgid ""
"You create a folder by clicking the |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Create Folder` "
"icon in the project bin toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Priečinok vytvoríte kliknutím na ikonu |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Create "
"Folder` na paneli nástrojov projektového zásobníka."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:57
msgid ""
"Alternatively, right-click on empty space in the project bin and select |"
"folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Create Folder`."
msgstr ""
"Prípadne kliknite pravým tlačidlom myši na prázdne miesto v projektovom "
"zásobníku a vyberte |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Create Folder`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:59
msgid ""
"If you want to create a folder below an existing one, select that folder "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete vytvoriť priečinok pod existujúcim, najprv vyberte ten existujúci."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:61
msgid ""
"You can delete a folder by selecting the folder and clicking on the |edit-"
"delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete Folder` icon, or by right-click on the folder "
"and selecting |edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete Folder`."
msgstr ""
"Priečinok môžete odstrániť výberom priečinka a kliknutím na ikonu |edit-"
"delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete Folder`, alebo kliknutím pravým tlačidlom myši "
"na priečinok a výberom |edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete Folder`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:66
msgid "Folder Right-Click Menu"
msgstr "Kontextové menu priečinka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:67
msgid "Right-click on a folder opens this context menu:"
msgstr ""
"Kliknutie pravým tlačidlom myši na priečinok otvorí toto kontextové menu:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:73
msgid "|rename|:"
msgstr "|rename|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:73
msgid ""
"Renames the folder. Keyboard shortcut is :kbd:`F2`. You can also just double-"
"click the folder name in the bin"
msgstr ""
"Premenuje priečinok. Klávesová skratka je :kbd:`F2`. Môžete tiež jednoducho "
"dvakrát kliknúť na názov priečinka v zásobníku"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:76
msgid "|open_new_bin|:"
msgstr "|open_new_bin|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:76
msgid "Creates a new bin from the folder"
msgstr "Vytvorí nový zásobník z priečinka"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:79
msgid "|target_seq|:"
msgstr "|target_seq|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:79
msgid "Check this if you want this folder to be target for new sequences"
msgstr ""
"Zaškrtnite, ak chcete, aby bol tento priečinok cieľom pre nové sekvencie"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:82
msgid "|target_audio|:"
msgstr "|target_audio|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:82
msgid "Select this if you want this folder to receive all audio captures"
msgstr ""
"Vyberte, ak chcete, aby tento priečinok prijímal všetky zvukové záznamy"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:85
msgid "|create_folder|:"
msgstr "|create_folder|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:85
msgid ""
"Creates a new folder. If nothing has been selected in the bin, a new folder "
"is created at the bin level. If a folder has been selected, a new folder "
"underneath the selected one is created."
msgstr ""
"Vytvorí nový priečinok. Ak v zásobníku nie je nič vybrané, vytvorí sa nový "
"priečinok na úrovni zásobníka. Ak je vybraný priečinok, vytvorí sa nový "
"priečinok pod vybraným."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:88
msgid "|delete_folder|:"
msgstr "|delete_folder|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:88
msgid "Deletes the selected folder."
msgstr "Odstráni vybraný priečinok."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:91
msgid ""
"Deleting an empty folder happens immediately without any are-you-sure? "
"dialog. Only if there is content will there be a warning dialog window that "
"you need to confirm or cancel."
msgstr ""
"Odstránenie prázdneho priečinka prebehne okamžite bez akéhokoľvek "
"potvrdzovacieho dialógu. Iba ak priečinok obsahuje obsah, zobrazí sa varovné "
"dialógové okno, ktoré je potrebné potvrdiť alebo zrušiť."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Using the Project Bin - Multiple Bins"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Using the Project Bin - Multiple Bins"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:29
msgid "Multiple Bins"
msgstr "Viacero zásobníkov"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:34
msgid ""
"Folders are a good way to stay organized but they are tied to the Project "
"Bin. If you need more flexibility you can create various bins from :ref:"
"`folders <create_folder>` you have created. The advantage of multiple bins "
"is that you can un-dock them, move them around your workspace, change the "
"sequence in the dock area, and even move them to a second (or third) monitor."
msgstr ""
"Priečinky sú dobrý spôsob, ako zostať organizovaný, ale sú viazané na "
"projektový zásobník. Ak potrebujete väčšiu flexibilitu, môžete vytvoriť "
"rôzne zásobníky z :ref:`priečinkov <create_folder>`, ktoré ste vytvorili. "
"Výhodou viacerých zásobníkov je, že ich môžete oddeliť od panela, presúvať "
"po pracovnom priestore, meniť ich poradie v paneli a dokonca ich presunúť na "
"druhý (alebo tretí) monitor."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:43
msgid "Turning folders into bins"
msgstr "Premena priečinkov na zásobníky"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:45
msgid ""
"Right-click the folder name and choose :guilabel:`Open Current Folder In New "
"Bin`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite pravým tlačidlom myši na názov priečinka a vyberte :guilabel:`Open "
"Current Folder In New Bin`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:47
msgid ""
"A bin can be closed either by clicking the |window-close|\\ :guilabel:`Close "
"Current Bin` icon on the bin toolbar, opening the |application-menu|\\ :"
"guilabel:`Options` menu and selecting :guilabel:`Close Current Bin` (you "
"must be in the bin), or by selecting the :menuselection:`Menu --> View --> "
"Project Bins` and un-ticking the respective bin in the list."
msgstr ""
"Zásobník môžete zatvoriť kliknutím na ikonu |window-close|\\ :guilabel:"
"`Close Current Bin` na paneli nástrojov zásobníka, otvorením menu |"
"application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Options` a výberom :guilabel:`Close Current "
"Bin` (musíte byť v zásobníku), alebo výberom :menuselection:`Menu --> View --"
"> Project Bins` a zrušením začiarknutia príslušného zásobníka v zozname."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:58
msgid "Additional icons in the toolbar"
msgstr "Ďalšie ikony na paneli nástrojov"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:60
msgid "Note the additional icons in the toolbar of the bin."
msgstr "Všimnite si ďalšie ikony na paneli nástrojov zásobníka."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:62
msgid ""
"|go-up|\\ :guilabel:`Go up` (keyboard shortcut :kbd:`Alt+UP`) goes up one "
"level in the current bin."
msgstr ""
"|go-up|\\ :guilabel:`Go up` (klávesová skratka :kbd:`Alt+UP`) prejde o jednu "
"úroveň vyššie v aktuálnom zásobníku."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_multiple_bins.rst:64
msgid "|window-close|\\ :guilabel:`Close Current Bin` closes the current bin."
msgstr ""
"|window-close|\\ :guilabel:`Close Current Bin` zatvorí aktuálny zásobník."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Using the Project Bin - Searching"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Using the Project Bin - Searching"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:29
#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:40
msgid "Searching the Project Bin"
msgstr "Vyhľadávanie v projektovom zásobníku"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:31
msgid "You can search by name for any asset in the Project Bin."
msgstr ""
"V projektovom zásobníku môžete vyhľadávať ľubovoľný prostriedok podľa názvu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:42
msgid ""
"Enter the search term into the :guilabel:`Search` field. Kdenlive will start "
"filtering the asset list immediately and continue adjusting the search "
"results as you type."
msgstr ""
"Zadajte hľadaný výraz do poľa :guilabel:`Search`. Kdenlive začne okamžite "
"filtrovať zoznam prostriedkov a bude priebežne upravovať výsledky "
"vyhľadávania počas písania."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:44
msgid ""
"Searching takes the entire filename including any suffixes (e.g. :file:`."
"ac3`) into account."
msgstr ""
"Vyhľadávanie zohľadňuje celý názov súboru vrátane prípon (napr. :file:`."
"ac3`)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_searching.rst:49
msgid ""
"Searching takes place only in the current view. If you want to search in "
"folders you must open the folder first."
msgstr ""
"Vyhľadávanie prebieha iba v aktuálnom zobrazení. Ak chcete vyhľadávať v "
"priečinkoch, musíte priečinok najprv otvoriť."

