#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_sorting.rst:48
msgid "You can sort the project bin content by various criteria."
msgstr "Obsah projektového zásobníka môžete zoradiť podľa rôznych kritérií."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_sorting.rst:58
